</text><text class="terminal-191455145-r5" x="12.2" y="874" textLength="219.6" clip-path="url(#terminal-191455145-line-35)">proc(id,&#160;*a,&#160;**kw)</text><text class="terminal-191455145-r3" x="231.8" y="874" textLength="1098" clip-path="url(#terminal-191455145-line-35)">&#160;&#160;`@proc(id,&#160;&quot;py&quot;,&#160;input=&lt;gen&gt;,&#160;**params)`&#160;on&#160;`def&#160;f(p[,&#160;inp])&#160;-&gt;&#160;{&quot;dims&quot;:&#160;[...],&#160;&quot;lines&quot;:</text><text class="terminal-191455145-r2" x="1708" y="874" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-191455145-line-35)">
</text><text class="terminal-191455145-r13" x="12.2" y="898.4" textLength="988.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-191455145-line-36)">[[[x,&#160;y,&#160;...dims]]]}`:&#160;a&#160;brain&#160;proc&#160;whose&#160;evaluation&#160;runs&#160;here.&#160;The&#160;brain&#160;queries</text><text class="terminal-191455145-r2" x="1708" y="898.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-191455145-line-36)">
</text><text class="terminal-191455145-r13" x="12.2" y="922.8" textLength="1037" clip-path="url(#terminal-191455145-line-37)">`asemic/py/&lt;id&gt;`&#160;(params&#160;+&#160;seed,&#160;`inp`&#160;=&#160;input&#160;gen&#x27;s&#160;`Points`)&#160;when&#160;those&#160;change&#160;/&#160;on</text><text class="terminal-191455145-r2" x="1708" y="922.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-191455145-line-37)">
</text><text class="terminal-191455145-r13" x="12.2" y="947.2" textLength="915" clip-path="url(#terminal-191455145-line-38)">COOK&#160;and&#160;publishes&#160;the&#160;cached&#160;reply&#160;every&#160;frame.&#160;Other&#160;kinds&#160;-&gt;&#160;brain&#160;verb.</text><text class="terminal-191455145-r2" x="1708" y="947.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-191455145-line-38)">
